{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gunpowder_keg","model_identifier":"gunpowder_keg","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## gunpowder_keg\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..4.2, y -3.0..6.5, z -8.2..0.1 (size 8.3 x 9.5 x 8.3 u = 23 x 27 x 23 cm).\nGunpowder keg: a small iron-hooped keg (~25 cm) with the red danger band round its middle and a cork bung on top, carried in the arms. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## gunpowder_keg\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..4.2, y -3.0..6.5, z -8.2..0.1 (size 8.3 x 9.5 x 8.3 u = 23 x 27 x 23 cm).\nGunpowder keg: a small iron-hooped keg (~25 cm) with the red danger band round its middle and a cork bung on top, carried in the arms. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"keg","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,-3.0,-7.5],"to":[3.5,6.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[54,0,61.0,9.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,9,7.0,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[7,9,14.0,18.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[14,9,21.0,18.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[53,9,60.0,16.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,18,7.0,25.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","